@startuml fence_transition_fsm
title TPP-IntelliFence — Fence Transition FSM (FenceTransitionState_t)

skinparam state {
    BorderColor Black
    FontSize 12
    ArrowFontSize 11
}
skinparam ArrowColor DarkSlateGray

[*] --> FENCE_TRANSITION_BEGIN

FENCE_TRANSITION_BEGIN --> FENCE_TRANSITION_DISABLE_STIMULUS

FENCE_TRANSITION_DISABLE_STIMULUS --> FENCE_TRANSITION_WAIT_STIMULUS_RESPONSE : sendZoneToStimulus(BLACK_ZONE)\n(timeout 5 s)

FENCE_TRANSITION_WAIT_STIMULUS_RESPONSE --> FENCE_TRANSITION_GPSRATE_FAST         : MSG_ID_STIMULUS_FEEDBACK OK\n+ fence válido guardado
FENCE_TRANSITION_WAIT_STIMULUS_RESPONSE --> FENCE_TRANSITION_END                   : MSG_ID_STIMULUS_FEEDBACK OK\npero sin fence válido
FENCE_TRANSITION_WAIT_STIMULUS_RESPONSE --> FENCE_TRANSITION_DISABLE_STIMULUS      : timeout

FENCE_TRANSITION_GPSRATE_FAST --> FENCE_TRANSITION_WAIT_GPS_ADQ_TIME : (comentado: updateGpsAdqTime\nFAST future impl.)

FENCE_TRANSITION_WAIT_GPS_ADQ_TIME --> FENCE_TRANSITION_REQUEST_POSITION

FENCE_TRANSITION_REQUEST_POSITION --> FENCE_TRANSITION_WAIT_POSITION : envía MSG_ID_REQUEST_GPS\n(timeout 10 s)

FENCE_TRANSITION_WAIT_POSITION --> FENCE_TRANSITION_REQUEST_ZONE    : MSG_ID_SEND_GPS\n+ posición válida
FENCE_TRANSITION_WAIT_POSITION --> FENCE_TRANSITION_REQUEST_POSITION : timeout

FENCE_TRANSITION_REQUEST_ZONE --> FENCE_TRANSITION_END               : zona == GREEN_ZONE\n(getZoneFromDistance)
FENCE_TRANSITION_REQUEST_ZONE --> FENCE_TRANSITION_REQUEST_POSITION  : zona != GREEN_ZONE\n(vaca fuera del cerco)

FENCE_TRANSITION_END --> FENCE_TRANSITION_BEGIN : resetea estado interno

state NORMAL_OPERATION #LightGreen : [MainFSM → NORMAL_OPERATION]
FENCE_TRANSITION_END --> NORMAL_OPERATION

@enduml
